{"kind":"stdout","t":2.18,"data":{"type":"command_lifecycle","command_uuid":"084c79b8-1a41-42eb-834a-398a2bf15aad","state":"queued","uuid":"8955740d-f486-482d-bb6a-5e1e8e136a27","session_id":"f392dd6d-81ad-4b55-99cd-e303ad714c2b"}}
{"kind":"stdout","t":5.083,"data":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfrsQ5mGdicbvMxbvYE1s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# The Lighthouse Keeper\n\nMarcus had kept the light for forty years, climbing the spiral stairs each evening without fail. The beam swept across the dark ocean, a constant guardian for ships finding their way home through fog and storm.\n\nFew visited anymore. Automation had made keepers like him obsolete, yet the station remained—a relic of duty. He lived alone with the rhythm of waves and the methodical turning of the Fresnel lens, its glass prisms catching starlight.\n\nOne autumn night, a fishing vessel's radio died mid-storm. Marcus watched from his tower as the boat drifted, running dark and blind. Without hesitation, he increased the light's intensity, angling the beam lower than protocol allowed, painting a bright path across violent swells.\n\nThe captain saw it. Followed it. The boat limped into harbor safely.\n\nWhen authorities arrived to investigate the deviation, they found Marcus at his post, unchanged. The captain appeared days later, pressing the old man's weathered hand, speaking of the light that saved his crew.\n\nMarcus smiled—not because he'd been vindicated, but because he understood what others had forgotten: some duties transcend regulations. Some lights are meant to shine brighter when darkness calls loudest."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10240,"cache_read_input_tokens":13696,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10240},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f392dd6d-81ad-4b55-99cd-e303ad714c2b","uuid":"51f4922d-e74a-444f-ad3c-2db6a4b3f8ed","time